{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"UserPermissions\">User Permissions</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Business By Edit Is On RestrictedUser ServerEdition Settings To ToDate User UserPermissions Users\">If you're using the cloud or server edition, you can adjust the access levels for <em>restricted users</em> within this specific business file by navigating to the <strong>User Permissions</strong> section under the <strong>Settings</strong> tab.</p><div class=\"flex pointer-events-none space-x-6 rtl:space-x-reverse items-center\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block ltr:pr-8 rtl:pl-8\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-200 ltr:pl-8 rtl:pr-8\"><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"border-y ltr:border-l rtl:border-r border-neutral-300 bg-white p-4 flex gap-2 items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-cog text-neutral-400\"></i><span class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Settings\">Settings</span></span></div><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div></div></div><span class=\"rtl:hidden\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-chevron-right text-lg text-neutral-300\"></i></span><span class=\"ltr:hidden\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-chevron-left text-lg text-neutral-300\"></i></span><div class=\"border rounded inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"basis-72 flex items-center gap-2 p-4\"><i class=\"text-xl text-neutral-400 fas fa-fw fa-user-lock\"></i><span class=\"text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"UserPermissions\">User Permissions</span></span></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Business Businesses Date From FromDate Is On To ToDate User UserPermissions Users View\">Typically, you don't need to access this screen directly. You can access user permissions across all users and all businesses in a consolidated view from the <strong>Users</strong> tab.</p><p><span translate=\"true\" keywords=\"On\">For more information, see:</span> <a href=\"/guides/users\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Users\">Users</span></a></p>",
